            {
              "id": "getting-help:bring:1e03n8z",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bucket_of_milk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bucket of milk</a>",
              "text": "Bucket of milk"
            }
          ],
          "recommended": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-help:14mt91d",
          "html": "Teleport to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Canifis_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Canifis lodestone</a>.",
          "text": "Teleport to Canifis lodestone.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-help:6wd76i",
          "html": "If you haven&#39;t already made nettle tea, pick some <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Nettles_(scenery)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">nettles</a> just east. Use the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Nettles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">nettles</a> on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bowl_of_water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bowl of water</a> to get <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Nettle-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">nettle-water</a>.",
          "text": "If you haven't already made nettle tea, pick some nettles just east. Use the nettles on the bowl of water to get nettle-water.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-help:1xoxla6",
          "html": "Head north-west to Netty&#39;s house which is on the east side of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Slayer_Tower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Slayer Tower</a>, talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Netty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Netty</a> in her house.",
          "text": "Head north-west to Netty's house which is on the east side of the Slayer Tower, talk to Netty in her house.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "You are doing so much for me - is there anything I can do for you?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-help:hkm1og",
          "html": "If you haven&#39;t already made nettle tea, run south of Netty&#39;s house and cut down a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Swamp_tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">swamp tree</a> for <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Logs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">logs</a>. Light a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fire</a> and use the nettle-water on it to get nettle tea. It is possible to accidentally boil your tea over.",
          "text": "If you haven't already made nettle tea, run south of Netty's house and cut down a swamp tree for logs. Light a fire and use the nettle-water on it to get nettle tea. It is possible to accidentally boil your tea over.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-help:11isxnn",
          "html": "Talk to Netty to get her <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Porcelain_cup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">porcelain cup</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to Netty to get her porcelain cup.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I'm here about Necrovarus."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-help:1w91mlq",
          "html": "<i>Use</i> your <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Nettle_tea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">nettle tea</a> on her cup, and <i>use</i> your <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bucket_of_milk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bucket of milk</a> on it.",
          "text": "Use your nettle tea on her cup, and use your bucket of milk on it.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-help:1kov8xa",
          "html": "Talk to Netty again.",
          "text": "Talk to Netty again.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I'm here about Necrovarus."
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "You are doing so much for me - is there anything I can do for you?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-help:3mt6q9",
          "html": "Repair the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Model_ship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">model ship</a> with the silk. Bring <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Thread\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">thread</a> just in case.",
          "text": "Repair the model ship with the silk. Bring thread just in case.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
