        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Dyeing the ship"
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-map:1jnwzxp",
          "html": "Wait for the &quot;wind speed&quot; to become &quot;low&quot;, which is shown on the top of the screen. Search the mast to determine the colours and their positions. You need to search for 3 different results, take note if needed.",
          "text": "Wait for the \"wind speed\" to become \"low\", which is shown on the top of the screen. Search the mast to determine the colours and their positions. You need to search for 3 different results, take note if needed.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-map:159j96a",
          "html": "Dye the model ship with the same colours and position as the mast. Orange dye is made from red and yellow; green dye is made from blue and yellow; purple dye is made from red and blue dye. If you make a mistake when painting, simply paint over the piece again.",
          "text": "Dye the model ship with the same colours and position as the mast. Orange dye is made from red and yellow; green dye is made from blue and yellow; purple dye is made from red and blue dye. If you make a mistake when painting, simply paint over the piece again.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Notes on colours<br>Top half<br>Red<br>Blue<br>Yellow<br>Orange<br>Green<br>Purple<br>Bottom half<br>Red<br>Blue<br>Yellow<br>Orange<br>Green<br>Purple<br>Skull emblem<br>Red<br>Blue<br>Yellow<br>Orange<br>Green<br>Purple"
